{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the power of music in <i>Melodic Mage</i>, a 2D pixel art action shooter where every attack and dodge must follow the rhythm! Play as a wizard battling through dynamic levels, casting spells, dashing, and dodging\u2014<i>all in sync with the beat</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Rhythm-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Cast spells and dodge enemy attacks in sync with the music.<br>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Magical Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Unlock and choose between different mages.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Conquer diverse levels, each with their own final boss.<br>\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Hard mode\u00a0</strong>\u2013 For those looking for a challenge, the hard mode will punish you every time you miss a beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the rhythm. Control the magic. <i>Become the Melodic Mage!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515490?t=1761606431","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3515490?t=1761606431","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515490/b81add66fa0ba686e8b9747a791a40f5769b61a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761606431","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515490/b81add66fa0ba686e8b9747a791a40f5769b61a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761606431","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3536800,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the power of music in <i>Melodic Mage</i>, a 2D pixel art action shooter where every attack and dodge must follow the rhythm! Play as a wizard battling through dyna